{"about_the_game":"Step into the role of an ostrich farm owner, where your goal is to breed the most striking ostriches. It's more than just about looks; smart strategies, good timing, and a little bit of luck will take your business to a whole new level.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/FeatherDivider.png?t=1750184846\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Breed Colorful Ostriches:</strong> Selectively breed a multitude of extravagant ostriches.<br></li><li> <strong>Fulfill Orders:</strong> Your birds are in high demand! Deliver the requested ostriches to earn rewards.<br></li><li> <strong>Unlock Rare Variations:</strong> Discover rare mutations in the form of over 1 million unique combinations of colors, patterns, beak shapes and hairstyles.<br></li><li> <strong>Watch Your Ostriches Interact:</strong> Observe delightful mating dances and social behaviors.<br></li><li> <strong>Expand Your Farm:</strong> Expand your farm to provide more space for your growing ostrich population.<br></li><li> <strong>Collect Achievements:</strong> Challenge yourself and accomplish various milestones to collect achievements that reflect your expertise as a skilled ostrich breeder.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/FeatherDividerUp.png?t=1750184846\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Social Behavior</h2>Observe charming dances when your ostriches try to impress each other.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/OstrichFarm_Breeding.gif?t=1750184846\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Baby Steps</h2>Witness the first steps of your baby ostriches. Every hatchling brings a fresh wave of excitement and potential.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/OstrichFarm_Babies.gif?t=1750184846\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Rewards</h2>Use rewards to enhance your breeding strategies and boost your farm's productivity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/OstrichFarm_Rewards.gif?t=1750184846\" /></div>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2549930?t=1750184846","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750184846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/c628c621ad364d752ae6cb54262ca84140b0c75c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750184846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/c628c621ad364d752ae6cb54262ca84140b0c75c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750184846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Step into the role of an ostrich farm owner, where your goal is to breed the most striking ostriches. It's more than just about looks; smart strategies, good timing, and a little bit of luck will take your business to a whole new level.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/FeatherDivider.png?t=1750184846\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_t